-- title:
--   Persistence of the p-th-power norm condition on S-idèle classes
-- statement:
--   Fix a natural number $p$ and a finite set $S$ of rational primes, and let $L'\le F$ be intermediate fields of $\overline{\mathbb Q}/\mathbb Q$ that are number fields, with $F/\mathbb Q$ Galois. Let $F_0$ be a number field that is a Galois extension of $L'$, together with a ring homomorphism $e\colon F_0\to F$ agreeing with the inclusion $L'\hookrightarrow F$ on $L'$. For a number field, write $T$ for the set of height-one primes $w$ of its ring of integers containing some $p\in S$, and let the $S$-idèle class group be the quotient of $(\mathbb A^\times)$ by the subgroup generated by the principal idèles together with the unit idèles that are units outside $T$ and trivial at $T$. Let $D_0$ be an idèlic Galois descent datum for $F_0/L'$ (a continuous monoid homomorphism from $\mathrm{Gal}(F_0/L')$ to the ring automorphisms of the adèle ring of $F_0$, compatible with the action on $F_0$) whose induced action on unit idèles preserves that last subgroup, so that it descends to an action `sClassAct` on the $S$-idèle class group. Assume every class $c_0$ of $F_0$ satisfies $\prod_{g\in\mathrm{Gal}(F_0/L')} g\cdot c_0=d_0^{\,p}$ for some $d_0$ fixed by all of $\mathrm{Gal}(F_0/L')$ (the product taken as a `finprod`). Then for every descent datum $D$ for $F/\mathbb Q$ with the same stabilisation property and every $S$-idèle class $c$ of $F$, there is a class $d$ of $F$, fixed by every element of the subgroup $H\le\mathrm{Gal}(F/\mathbb Q)$ fixing the image of $L'$ in $F$ pointwise, with $\prod_{g\in H} g\cdot c=d^{\,p}$.
--
--   This is the transport step of a Herbrand-style norm argument: a $p$-th-power-of-invariants statement for $S$-idèle classes, known for an abstract finite Galois extension $F_0/L'$, is propagated to any Galois descent datum on the idèles of a Galois number field $F\subseteq\overline{\mathbb Q}$ containing $L'$, with the relative Galois group replaced by the fixing subgroup of the image of $L'$. It is used by [`IntermediateField.exists_le_isGalois_dvd_finrank_forall_prod_fixingSubgroup_sClassAct_eq_pow`](thm.html#IntermediateField.exists_le_isGalois_dvd_finrank_forall_prod_fixingSubgroup_sClassAct_eq_pow), whose conclusion it reproduces clause by clause.
